msgid "Ancient wonders, lively markets and a famous food scene along the Nile."
msgstr "عجائب أثرية وأسواق نابضة بالحياة ومطبخ شهير على ضفاف النيل."

msgid "A Caspian capital mixing a medieval old city with modern skyline and great food."
